Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:36:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Router MUL_MAT (1 token, F32, mul_mat_vec_f 256-thread shape)
 + topk-moe in one launch: each topk_moe_cuda block computes one logit as
 mul_mat_vec_f does, the last one (self-resetting counter) runs the unchanged
 selection. Bit-identical; on r176 + graph-order 0001, Qwen3-30B-A3B tg128
 +2.0 %, Qwen3.6-35B-A3B +1.1 % on 7900 XTX. GGML_CUDA_ROUTER_TOPK=0 off

---
